1
00:00:00,599 --> 00:00:03,599
When are you gonna stop
making Cylon toast?

2
00:00:04,269 --> 00:00:06,559
(Sheldon:)When I have enough to destroy
the human toast...

3
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:09,110
(Sheldon:)...on the Battlestar
known as Galactica.

4
00:00:11,318 --> 00:00:13,528
(Sheldon:)Is that what you're wearing
to watch football?

5
00:00:13,987 --> 00:00:16,277
(Leonard:)-What's wrong with a football jersey?
-Nothing.

6
00:00:16,448 --> 00:00:19,448
(Sheldon:)That, however,
appears to be a football cocktail dress.

7
00:00:22,996 --> 00:00:24,626
It's the smallest size they had.

8
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:27,170
(Leonard:)Except the one for dogs.

9
00:00:28,085 --> 00:00:30,045
(Leonard:)I can't believe they had one for dogs.

10
00:00:30,212 --> 00:00:33,962
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes. Canine football fans
are a common sight in Texas.

11
00:00:34,132 --> 00:00:37,382
(Sheldon:)Cats, however,
refuse to wear sporting apparel.

12
00:00:38,428 --> 00:00:40,638
(Sheldon:)My sister found that out the hard way.

13
00:00:41,723 --> 00:00:44,393
(Leonard:)-Anyway, wish me luck.
-Leonard, wait.

